{"meta":{"id":"file-upload","category":"it/syntax/java/servlet","title":"실제 경로 · 파일 업로드 · Java","subtitle":"(JAVA)","summary":"getRealPath 로 서버 경로, cos.jar MultipartRequest 업로드와 파일명 처리","tags":["java","f-network"],"color":"cyan","watermarkClass":"watermark-bg-blog-cyan","source":"언어별사용 정리.xlsx","updatedAt":"2026-10-12"},"html":"<div class=\"absolute -top-12 -right-12 w-48 h-48 bg-cyan-200/40 rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-70 pointer-events-none\"></div>\r\n<div class=\"relative pb-5 border-b border-cyan-200/70\">\r\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-2.5\">\r\n<span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-cyan-50 text-cyan-700 border border-cyan-300/60 tracking-wider\"><span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-cyan-500\"></span>JAVA</span>\r\n</div>\r\n<h1 class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-tight leading-snug\">실제 경로 · 파일 업로드 · Java</h1>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 flex items-start gap-2 bg-cyan-50/70 border border-cyan-200/60 rounded-xl p-3\"><svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-cyan-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-700 leading-relaxed font-medium\"><strong class=\"text-stone-900\">요약:</strong> getRealPath 로 서버 경로, cos.jar MultipartRequest 업로드와 파일명 처리</p></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-cyan-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">실제 서버 경로 — getRealPath</h2></div><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">java</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">ServletContext application = request.getServletContext();\r\nString path1 = application.getRealPath(&quot;/AAA&quot;);    // .../wtpwebapps/프로젝트/AAA\r\nString path2 = application.getRealPath(&quot;./AAA&quot;);   // 위와 같음\r\nString path3 = application.getRealPath(&quot;../AAA&quot;);  // null — 웹앱 밖은 불가</pre></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">\"/\" 는 프로젝트의 webapp 폴더(톰캣 배포 위치)를 뜻한다. 이클립스 실행 시에는 workspace/.metadata 아래 임시 배포 폴더</p></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-cyan-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">파일 업로드 (cos.jar)</h2></div><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">java</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">String realPath = request.getServletContext().getRealPath(&quot;/images/pdstest&quot;);  // 실제 저장 위치 (톰캣 내부)\r\nint maxSize = 1024 * 1024 * 10;       // 최대 10MB (1024 = 1KB, 1024*1024 = 1MB)\r\nString encoding = &quot;UTF-8&quot;;\r\n\r\nMultipartRequest multi = new MultipartRequest(request, realPath, maxSize, encoding,\r\n                                              new DefaultFileRenamePolicy());  // 같은 이름이면 A1, A2 …\r\n\r\nString originalFileName = multi.getOriginalFileName(&quot;fName&quot;);   // 사용자가 올린 원본 이름\r\nString filesystemName   = multi.getFilesystemName(&quot;fName&quot;);     // 서버에 저장된 이름\r\nString title = multi.getParameter(&quot;title&quot;);                     // 다른 입력값도 multi 로 받음</pre></div><div class=\"space-y-1.5 text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 pl-1\"><div class=\"tip-bullet-row\"><span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-cyan-600\">•</span><span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">form 에 <code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>enctype=&quot;multipart/form-data&quot;</code> + <code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>method=&quot;post&quot;</code> 필수</span></div><div class=\"tip-bullet-row\"><span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-cyan-600\">•</span><span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">업로드 요청에서는 request.getParameter 가 null — MultipartRequest 로 받는다</span></div><div class=\"tip-bullet-row\"><span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-cyan-600\">•</span><span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">Spring 에서는 MultipartFile 매개변수로 받는다</span></div></div></div>\r\n","path":"it/syntax/java/servlet/file-upload","breadcrumb":[{"id":"root","title":"Home","path":""},{"id":"it","title":"IT","path":"it"},{"id":"syntax","title":"프로그램 언어(문법)","path":"it/syntax"},{"id":"java","title":"JAVA","path":"it/syntax/java"},{"id":"servlet","title":"서블릿 (웹)","path":"it/syntax/java/servlet"}],"hasImage":false}